    <string name="restricted_steps">1. Press \"Open settings\" in step 1 and try to turn it on. When Android refuses, close the window.\n2. Press the button below. In App info, tap ⋮ in the top right corner → \"Allow restricted settings\" and confirm.\n3. Come back here and turn on steps 1 and 2.</string>
